        g2q("G2G-C01-003",71,"A Package Full of Weed","Side Quest","Khorinis","Militia","Route stage 5 — Choose your main faction","Find the swampweed package Lord Andre wants confiscated.","After joining the Militia, ask Lord Andre for work.§Follow leads through Mortis and Kardif to the harbor warehouse near Garvell.§Defeat the warehouse guard, take his key, open the chest and recover the package.§Return to Andre.","You can claim you threw the package into the harbor and keep it for Cipher’s related quest, or surrender it to Andre."),
