        g2q("G2G-C01-040",75,"Joining the Mercenaries","Side Quest","Onar’s Farm","Faction entry","Route stage 5 — Choose your main faction","Become one of Lee’s mercenaries.","Reach Onar’s farm and speak with Lee/Torlof.§Complete Respect of the Mercenaries, earn enough votes or satisfy the required tests, then return to Lee and formally join.","Locks you onto the mercenary → Dragon Hunter route."),
