        g2q("G2G-C01-068",77,"The Easy Way to the Monastery","Side Quest","Khorinis / Monastery","Ring of Water","Route stage 5 — Choose your main faction","Use Vatras/Lares to enter the monastery without the normal full offering.","Ask Lares about the monastery route, then speak to Vatras and follow the special statue/tribute chain.§Bring the valuable Innos statue to Pedro/Gorax as instructed.","Night of the Raven alternative to paying 1,000 gold plus a sheep."),
